    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "A binary operation is defined by a o b = a² + b. Find 3 o 4."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Think first: Replace a with 3 and b with 4, and square before you add."
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "storagePath": "assets/question_visuals/p057_q03.jpg",
      "altText": "Source visual for edmar-csec-p057-q03 from workbook page 57."
    }
